        <custom_item>
          type                 : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
          description          : "1.0123 - MSSRV - Ensure Configure enhanced anti-spoofing is set to Enabled"
          info                 : "This policy setting determines whether enhanced anti-spoofing is configured for devices which support it."
