        <custom_item>
          type                 : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
          description          : "1.0142 - MSSRV - Ensure MSS: (WarningLevel) Percentage threshold for the security event log at which the system will generate a warning is set to Enabled: 90% or less"
          info                 : "This setting can generate a security audit in the Security event log when the log reaches a user-defined threshold."
