        </custom_item>

        <custom_item>
          type                 : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
          description          : "1.0143 - MSSRV - Ensure MSS: (DisableIPSourceRouting IPv6) IP source routing protection level is set to Enabled: Highest protection, source routing is completely disabled"
          info                 : "IP source routing is a mechanism that allows the sender to determine the IP route that a datagram should follow through the network."
